config DRM_ACCEL_N1X
	tristate "NVIDIA N1X DLA compute accelerator"
	depends on DRM_ACCEL && ARM64 && ACPI && HAS_IOMEM && IOMMU_DMA && PM
	select FW_LOADER
	help
	  Support the NVDA200A DLA and NVDA8600 SROOT endpoints using the
	  DRM compute-accelerator interface. Requires the original signed
	  NVIDIA firmware, suitable IOMMU mappings, and the platform's
	  supported HFRP/SROOT firmware protocols.

	  The driver retains memory after an uncertain hardware failure.
	  Published DSP leases prevent shutdown and system sleep until reboot.
	  This build integration does not establish upstream readiness or
	  hardware qualification on other N1X systems.
